0 Side scoop: moving part (origin at the arm axle)
0 Name: scoop-moving.ldr
0 Author: FLL Practice
0 Two 4 x 6 bent liftarms on the motor E axle reach forward and down; an axle across their tips carries two cross
0 blocks, which hold a 15-long beam reaching out to the left. At its end a Technic brick on a 2 x 2 plate stands on a
0 2 x 14 plate lying on the mat: the scoop. It slides under the M12 cane's claw to lift it over, and its tip hooks
0 the support tie.
